[NewProjectDialog]
title:
  src: Create New Project
  tr: 新建工程

description:
  src: Create a project directory and start with an empty workspace.
  tr: 创建工程目录并开始一个空工作区。

project-name:
  src: Project name
  tr: 工程名称

placeholder-name:
  src: My Project
  tr: 我的工程

create-in:
  src: Create in
  tr: 创建位置

placeholder-folder:
  src: Choose a folder
  tr: 选择文件夹

project-location:
  src: Project location
  tr: 工程位置

folder-note:
  src: The project folder and .panta file will be created if they do not already exist.
  tr: 如果工程文件夹和 .panta 文件不存在，将自动创建。

choose-location:
  src: Choose Project Location
  tr: 选择工程位置

error-name:
  src: Enter a valid project name.
  tr: 请输入有效的工程名称。

error-location:
  src: Choose an absolute project location.
  tr: 请选择绝对工程路径。

error-location-create:
  src: The project location could not be created.
  tr: 无法创建工程位置。

error-root:
  src: The selected project cannot be found.
  tr: 找不到所选工程。

error-exists:
  src: A project with this name already exists.
  tr: 同名工程已经存在。

error-manifest:
  src: The selected folder is not a supported panta project.
  tr: 所选文件夹不是受支持的 panta 工程。

error-no-project:
  src: Open or create a project first.
  tr: 请先打开或创建工程。

error-command:
  src: The project change is not valid.
  tr: 工程修改无效。

error-generic:
  src: The project operation could not be completed.
  tr: 工程操作无法完成。

[ImportDialogForm]
description:
  src: Select a mesh type and units before importing the STL file.
  tr: 导入 STL 文件前请选择网格类型和单位。

choose-file:
  src: Choose an STL file
  tr: 选择 STL 文件

stl-file:
  src: STL file
  tr: STL 文件

mesh-type:
  src: Mesh type
  tr: 网格类型

units:
  src: Units
  tr: 单位

dimensions:
  src: Approximate dimensions
  tr: 近似尺寸

show-log:
  src: Show import log
  tr: 显示导入日志

[ImportDialogStatus]
select-file:
  src: Select an STL file
  tr: 请选择 STL 文件

[ImportDialogHelp]
help-text:
  src: The source file is copied into the project assets so the import can be reopened later.
  tr: 源文件会复制到工程资产目录，以便稍后重新打开导入记录。

[ImportDialogErrors]
error-file-missing:
  src: The selected STL file does not exist.
  tr: 所选 STL 文件不存在。

error-invalid-file:
  src: Choose an STL file to import.
  tr: 请选择要导入的 STL 文件。

error-parse:
  src: The selected STL file could not be read.
  tr: 无法读取所选 STL 文件。

error-copy:
  src: The STL file could not be copied into the project.
  tr: 无法将 STL 文件复制到工程中。

error-generic:
  src: The import operation could not be completed.
  tr: 导入操作无法完成。

